ue "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73319/selection/a6457768d72e76f431bfc0d14a35f8f9100dfadac6cd93a449c76fa4907d7bee" :answer/id #uuid "fe147f2b-dd6c-50a2-8624-dcc10267850e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-46" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73319/selection/e0e0a3ac4fe95f021c8f8aece7092270d36ad30c356733db1e628dc4f0b1d434" :answer/id #uuid "d66cd3d1-e484-558e-baa3-b97b1c04ee50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73319/selection/8642573b27c8383f67a645c39127977f20fbab89a940b170bac777f18f881b9b" :answer/id #uuid "8da95193-8058-5c27-8283-3b59408ff8b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73319/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d454a38-9ba8-58f8-b68e-2af8dc76037b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73319/selection/8642573b27c8383f67a645c39127977f20fbab89a940b170bac777f18f881b9b" :answer-field/choices ["q-73319/selection/ac46572169135c39bc2dc1bfb75349ed12f60a1187a3ef59cacec084b49d12ff" "q-73319/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" "q-73319/selection/a6457768d72e76f431bfc0d14a35f8f9100dfadac6cd93a449c76fa4907d7bee" "q-73319/selection/e0e0a3ac4fe95f021c8f8aece7092270d36ad30c356733db1e628dc4f0b1d434" "q-73319/selection/8642573b27c8383f67a645c39127977f20fbab89a940b170bac777f18f881b9b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73319" :question/id #uuid "045da1f5-585f-50b0-a924-5246fd98534c" :question/math-academy-id "q-73319" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{5}^{1}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-2$, calculate\n${\\int }_{1}^{5}(f(x)+4x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{5}^{1}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factoring out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(f(x)+4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+4{\\int }_{1}^{5}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2+4\\cdot {\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,|}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =2+2({5}^{2}-{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =2+48 \\\\  & =50.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73319/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff2f1a9d-2b0e-5a18-98d5-4f49f6f1527b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73319"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "62986d9f-787b-52ea-beb1-7ab62ba412b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776" :answer/id #uuid "a9968c03-d588-573c-9507-cbc3422119e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "e2dbe223-645b-5df0-b654-807a3d10ff05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection/2fa5baf88b61736a3022c72e24e172fda2b4270fffff6efaa1fc03fef23fccc2" :answer/id #uuid "0de6a3ae-c754-52b2-ac18-4be79113b5ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection/286fb92e9ba180b012d241bb7e762701483c9c864420d9df6597147f2e2fb458" :answer/id #uuid "42cec27c-6635-518c-85f2-e610275da339" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "28" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3fbb5dbd-83e9-54c1-9085-a33407090a26" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73341/selection/286fb92e9ba180b012d241bb7e762701483c9c864420d9df6597147f2e2fb458" :answer-field/choices ["q-73341/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-73341/selection/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776" "q-73341/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" "q-73341/selection/2fa5baf88b61736a3022c72e24e172fda2b4270fffff6efaa1fc03fef23fccc2" "q-73341/selection/286fb92e9ba180b012d241bb7e762701483c9c864420d9df6597147f2e2fb458"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73341" :question/id #uuid "f0db4b9e-8908-5d65-a628-6adf818864cf" :question/math-academy-id "q-73341" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{3}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2$ and ${\\int }_{4}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=6$ then what is ${\\int }_{3}^{7}(2f(x)+3)\\,\\text{d}x?$" :question/worked-solution "From the adjacent intervals rule, we know that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{4}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{3}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nPlugging in the known information into the above gives the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2+6={\\int }_{3}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ 8={\\int }_{3}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the desired integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{7}(2f(x)+3)\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{3}^{7}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+3{\\int }_{3}^{7}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(8)+3\\cdot x\\,{|}_{3}^{7} \\\\  & =16+3(7-3) \\\\  & =28.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73341/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9693b76e-ba77-5314-bfbf-508b25bb1072"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73341"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346187/field-1/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776" :answer/id #uuid "d08883f8-2bd8-51d9-9738-2b4a2ee078c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186298371 :answer-field/choices ["q-346187/field-1/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346197/field-1/a38ef12f135c1e6010d68ed21f81bc27372a73a756455b7066f6182c46018cc8" :answer/id #uuid "ca7b46ee-dca8-5a16-910f-d6a0eae420e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346197/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a43a8be-fd07-5e4f-b858-31c70459151b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346197/field-1/a38ef12f135c1e6010d68ed21f81bc27372a73a756455b7066f6182c46018cc8" :answer-field/choices ["q-346197/field-1/a38ef12f135c1e6010d68ed21f81bc27372a73a756455b7066f6182c46018cc8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346197" :question/id #uuid "a3a94b52-09ef-5e3b-95bc-abd8e35262ec" :question/math-academy-id "q-346197" :question/problem "Given that ${\\int }_{-2}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=1$ and ${\\int }_{2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=3,$ \nthen what is ${\\int }_{-2}^{6}(6f(x)+1)\\,\\text{d}x?$\n\n${\\int }_{-2}^{6}(6f(x)+1)\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the adjacent intervals rule, we know that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-2}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nPlugging in the known information gives\n\n$$\n1+3={\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\,⇒\\,{\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=4.\n$$\n\nFinally, compute the desired integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{6}(6f(x)+1)\\,\\text{d}x & =6{\\int }_{-2}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{-2}^{6}1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6(4)+x\\,{|}_{-2}^{6} \\\\  & =24+(6-(-2)) \\\\  & =24+8 \\\\  & =32\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-346197/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9693b76e-ba77-5314-bfbf-508b25bb1072"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346197"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346209/field-1/35f5572ccca3a8c38d3ca06e2a92b51065f48e45d29833e19f4eb153cae096fc" :answer/id #uuid "e65620d8-eaaa-5171-823e-087857c22465" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346209/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7e17e6cb-5215-5a37-9c99-a3d8004de3f3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346209/field-1/35f5572ccca3a8c38d3ca06e2a92b51065f48e45d29833e19f4eb153cae096fc" :answer-field/choices ["q-346209/field-1/35f5572ccca3a8c38d3ca06e2a92b51065f48e45d29833e19f4eb153cae096fc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346209" :question/id #uuid "094c3f1e-b09f-5c71-8d44-1fe87887214f" :question/math-academy-id "q-346209" :question/problem "Suppose that $f(x)$ is a function such that ${\\int }_{8}^{3}\\frac{5}{2}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=15$ and ${\\int }_{2}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{7}{2}.$ What is the value of ${\\int }_{2}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x?$\n\n${\\int }_{2}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's simplify one of the given integrals:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{8}^{3}\\frac{5}{2}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =15 \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{8}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =15 \\\\ -\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{3}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =15 \\\\ {\\int }_{3}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, from the adjacent intervals rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{3}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2}+(-6) \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-346209/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d752aac-6187-595d-8818-b0179fd7380e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346209"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-4725/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id 